OL,3,GNEWSABurglar leapt from court dock to
OL,4,Aavoid jail
OL,5,
OL,6,FA burglar who jumped out of a court
OL,7,Fdock and fled as a judge was planning
OL,8,Fto remand him into custody has been
OL,9,Fjailed for almost two years.
OL,11,FBrian Curtis, 45, ran away from
OL,12,FNewcastle Crown Court on 1 May and was
OL,13,F"unlawfully at large" for five days
OL,14,Fbefore police arrested him in Byker,
OL,15,Fthe court heard.
OL,17,FHe was previously part of a group who
OL,18,Fstole #3,000 worth of pictures from an
OL,19,Fapartment complex for the over 50s,
OL,20,Fwith police recognising him from his
OL,21,Fcoat and "distinctive nose".
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,397,390,260,160,0,100
