OL,3,GNEWSABurglar leapt from court dock to
OL,4,Aavoid jail
OL,5,
OL,6,FCurtis admitted burglary and escaping
OL,7,Flawful custody. He also pleaded guilty
OL,8,Fto stealing a bike that he took "with
OL,9,Fforce" when meeting the victim as a
OL,10,Fpotential buyer.
